### Create article
POST http://localhost:3000/articles
Content-Type:  application/json

{
  "title": "Three article",
  "text": "Simple second text",
  "description": "simple second",
  "tags": "second, simple"
}

### Get article list
GET http://localhost:3000/articles

### Get article by id
GET http://localhost:3000/articles/1

### Update article by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/articles/1
Content-Type:  application/json

{
  "title": "Change First article",
  "text": "Hard text",
  "description": "hard first",
  "tags": "first, hard"
}

### Delete article by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/articles/3


